{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id1004852919"}, "name":{"label":"IMO_2000"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-12-03T19:39:59-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.11.2"}, "id":{"label":"12023214985"}, "title":{"label":"Update broke streaming"}, "content":{"label":"I’ve been happily using Overcast every day for 5 years. This latest update has introduced new bugs where the podcasts stops without reason when streaming. Only downloaded podcasts will play. Sadly for the first time I’m going to try another platform.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id20688663"}, "name":{"label":"Hsk133"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-11-26T02:17:08-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.11.2"}, "id":{"label":"11993419195"}, "title":{"label":"Too many update bugs"}, "content":{"label":"Have loved and been a user for 8 years. Recent update has meant that will play one podcast and then stop with 4 secs to go. I have to keep selecting podcast in playlist. Streaming functionality rarely works and only plays for a min before skipping. Frustrating as it was well and truly the most user friendly, easy to use before mid 2024 updates.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id647016880"}, "name":{"label":"ApricityW"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-11-25T20:51:18-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.11.2"}, "id":{"label":"11992748162"}, "title":{"label":"Abysmal UI refresh"}, "content":{"label":"I’ve had this app for over 5 years and it always functioned beautifully; i.e., in the background. This year’s overhaul has completely ruined the experience for me, making things as simple as playing a podcast an absolute chore.\n\nI’ve switched apps now and won’t be looking back.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id14253362"}, "name":{"label":"Alex in Sydney"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-11-22T20:02:54-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.11.2"}, "id":{"label":"11981095524"}, "title":{"label":"Best Podcast Player By Far…"}, "content":{"label":"I’ve been using Overcast for over a decade. Amazing app and so many features that I actually use! Get it now!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id38588210"}, "name":{"label":"!ceman2011"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-11-20T09:54:11-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.11.1"}, "id":{"label":"11972095458"}, "title":{"label":"Simply the Best Podcast App"}, "content":{"label":"I have tried so many podcast apps and none come close. The playlists work great, the way you expect them to.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id48835928"}, "name":{"label":"sumi341"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-11-19T01:45:26-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.11"}, "id":{"label":"11967060928"}, "title":{"label":"New update was disappointing"}, "content":{"label":"I loved this app. I sang its praises for years. The new update is really annoying. I sort my playlist. By priority or chronologically, all new episodes just randomly insert itself at the top. When it's a lot you have to re-sort the playlist again. And sometimes do it the playlist will go back to whatever it did before and start again. Could be worse but then it's that what a playlist for? Please fix so that new episodes go to the bottom of the list not above the old ones?\n\nSometimes after listening to an episode, it goes to the next one and somehow tells me that the previous episode still has time left played. \n\nMinor niggly things that make the app more frustrating. I'm so used to the app that I've loved for years that I still wonder if I should give it anothet try….", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id131836268"}, "name":{"label":"Capt'n Cummo"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-11-17T19:40:44-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.11"}, "id":{"label":"11962735347"}, "title":{"label":"Destroys battery life"}, "content":{"label":"This is an amazing podcast app, however since the recent update it is destroying my battery life. Last 10 days: 23min screen+3h 10m background = 2%\nVS a different podcast app 1h 23min screen + 26h 25min background = 12%\nJust today 23min screen+3h 10m background = 25%", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
