{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id32857127"}, "name":{"label":"dompace"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-11-08T03:53:26-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.10.2"}, "id":{"label":"11926037305"}, "title":{"label":"Nonfunctional after new update"}, "content":{"label":"I understand the need to update the code or whatever, but the main function of a podcast app is to play podcasts and now it does not do this reliably at all. Without fail playback of episodes stops after one minute. It only works once the episode is downloaded fully, but if your internet isn’t fast enough to download fully before the one minute then it fails. Pausing it also crashes playback. It’s unusable and very disappointing, a good app that has been ruined", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id144253623"}, "name":{"label":"CHC69"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-11-05T12:06:02-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.10.2"}, "id":{"label":"11916523715"}, "title":{"label":"Playlist order not respected"}, "content":{"label":"I have a playlist with sort order oldest to newest, but all new episodes appear at the top of the list. This has only been a problem since the major update (which I deferred for ages on the advice of others). Hoping that this most basic function can be fixed before I give up on this app.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
