{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id36336567"}, "name":{"label":"Ulnagar"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-10-27T18:28:31-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.10.1"}, "id":{"label":"11882913324"}, "title":{"label":"Best podcast player available"}, "content":{"label":"Overcast just keeps getting better. Been using it for years and never been disappointed. Works great with Car Play, AirPods, anything I throw at it. Never disappointed.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id104925449"}, "name":{"label":"Hambo121212"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-10-23T02:05:37-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.10"}, "id":{"label":"11865058147"}, "title":{"label":"I love this app... Except for the latest update"}, "content":{"label":"Amazing app, but unfortunately some simple but important features have been removed, such as bulk download and delete. PLEASE add it back", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id37792010"}, "name":{"label":"Axman6"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-10-22T18:46:47-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.10"}, "id":{"label":"11864157457"}, "title":{"label":"Still issues but they’re improving"}, "content":{"label":"I’ve been using Overcast for years, the recent rewrite broke a lot of features I relied on, mostly related to priority podcasts still not being prioritised. I found a work around, a few times a day I go to the setting for the playlist and hit sort: oldest to newest, and the priority podcasts end up at the top where they should be, but it’s still badly broken otherwise. \nThis latest update is causing my phone to heat up massively and drain my battery with background activity.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id224523348"}, "name":{"label":"Evilkarlothian"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-10-11T18:57:03-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.9.1"}, "id":{"label":"11823759255"}, "title":{"label":"The best"}, "content":{"label":"Period", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id470011345"}, "name":{"label":"ozSteveMac"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-10-11T14:45:38-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.9.1"}, "id":{"label":"11823169095"}, "title":{"label":"Without question the best featured and designed podcast app"}, "content":{"label":"I’ve honestly tried all other options and currently have four subscriptions to podcast apps, but only one will renew, and that one is Overcast.\n\nSo many reasons why, but the main is the design care and consideration.  This app is a big step above in audio quality (for smart speed and voice boost).\n\nMarco (developer) has had a rough few months since making the decision to rewrite the app into swift, the fruits of this effort are starting to show with rapid new feature releases.\n\nGreat app, couldn’t recommend more highly.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id23902303"}, "name":{"label":"Matt -"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-10-09T22:58:06-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.9.1"}, "id":{"label":"11817089686"}, "title":{"label":"Very nicely done."}, "content":{"label":"Keeps my podcasts in line and my brain well fed.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id31421128"}, "name":{"label":"Muddy74"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-10-05T20:42:30-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.9.1"}, "id":{"label":"11802375819"}, "title":{"label":"They broke it!"}, "content":{"label":"The latest overhaul seems to have left the app mostly broken. I have used it for years mainly so I can have a manually ordered queue but this no longer seems possible. Lots of other bugs or lost functionality too. I really hope it gets fixed soon.\n\nAt the very least if you don’t return the ability to manually sort playlists give us back the ability to export settings so we can move seamlessly to another podcast app.\n\nThis used to be a decent app :(", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"2"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"2"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id205638001"}, "name":{"label":"Jctjalrsmg"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-10-04T16:07:03-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.9.1"}, "id":{"label":"11797952007"}, "title":{"label":"Best podcast app."}, "content":{"label":"Clearest, simplest podcast app there is. Used it for 5-6 years now with never a problem. If you could re-order the different saved podcasts it could be improved, but way better than the big Apple or Spotify podcast apps.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id85148926"}, "name":{"label":"Cosmic Walker"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-10-03T19:32:40-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.9.1"}, "id":{"label":"11794765746"}, "title":{"label":"App has been fixed"}, "content":{"label":"Most issues seem to be resolved now. No issues", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id139564193"}, "name":{"label":"Nkhz"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-10-02T22:44:19-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.9.1"}, "id":{"label":"11791503331"}, "title":{"label":"Key feature missing!"}, "content":{"label":"It's one of my top goto apps on my iPhone.\n\nHowever, one change has impacted my user experience significantly. \nPreviously, when a podcast finished playing, I could click once on my AirPods, and the next one in line would play. This feature no longer works.\n\nI have my settings configured to stop after each podcast because I listen to them as I go to sleep. If I haven't fallen asleep and want to listen to the next episode, I would simply click once on my headphones instead of picking up my iPhone.\n\nCould this feature be reinstated?", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id42899221"}, "name":{"label":"Lance_Vance_Dance"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-10-02T05:36:44-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.9.1"}, "id":{"label":"11788787014"}, "title":{"label":"Shadow of its former self"}, "content":{"label":"This app used to be the best in the business, but the developer decided to update it to align with Apple’s new advised language and ruined it in the process. \n\nThe UI is much worse, sleep timer is much harder to use and looks rubbish. Also introduced many bugs. I’ve been giving it many updates to see if it got better but it barely has. Also why is it now seemingly impossible to just select a podcast to play next!! And even if you get one in the queue in the right order will the next one you expect play? No. \n\nI understand the desire to update to a new code base. But this became the aim instead of delivering the best product, and as a result it no longer is. \nBack to Apple Podcasts for me.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id972932458"}, "name":{"label":"Robert Clover"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-09-28T01:34:21-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.9.1"}, "id":{"label":"11773280018"}, "title":{"label":"The only podcast app I love"}, "content":{"label":"I’ve been using this app since 2014 - first as a teenager, now as an adult. It’s very, very good. Like password managers, I try all the different options every now and then. And like 1Password, I keep landing back on Overcast, because it’s just that good. \n\nThere’s a few usability nitpicks here and there. The playlist interaction model isn’t very intuitive, and the podcast description is beneath the podcast chapters (to me, chapters would make more sense to have below the image, scrolling to get to them, or maybe expanding something?). \n\nThe fact that *that’s* the kind of thing that I take issue with says a lot more about the excellent state of the rest of this product. You can tell how much thought and care went into every corner of it.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id164701458"}, "name":{"label":"Sam Toohey"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-09-27T20:53:25-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.9.1"}, "id":{"label":"11772648441"}, "title":{"label":"Best podcasting app period"}, "content":{"label":"As an indie dev myself I know the push and stress Marco has gone through to do his current revision and get it to all his users. \nPersonally im a huge fan of the rebrand and moved over from pocket casts now to be fully on Overcast. \n\nGreat work Marco keep it up.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id169117640"}, "name":{"label":"Kathiawadi"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-09-27T04:16:13-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.9.1"}, "id":{"label":"11769912952"}, "title":{"label":"Great update"}, "content":{"label":"I’m not the one who agree with Marco on most of his views on so many things. But this app is really good and the update is really worth 5 stars. App really needed the makeover. Marco also delivered on most of the feedback as well.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id23386897"}, "name":{"label":"Logistes"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-09-26T23:16:22-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2024.9.1"}, "id":{"label":"11769238331"}, "title":{"label":"A labour of love, and it shows"}, "content":{"label":"I have used overcast for years as my main podcast listening app. It is well written and is there to play what I want, not to expose me to alternatives. That leaves the interface uncluttered, quick to use and put away.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
